    {
      "id": "c1",
      "start": 0.98,
      "end": 7.1,
      "text": "An agreement starts now in Bryan for a laboratory designed to let an experiment choose the next experiment. The agreement",
      "source": "measured_boundary"
    },
    {
      "id": "c2",
      "start": 7.72,
      "end": 11.5,
      "text": "turns that idea into a build plan for an autonomous laboratory.",
      "source": "measured_boundary"
    },
    {
      "id": "c3",
      "start": 12.16,
      "end": 18.24,
      "text": "Robots will melt the metal, shape it, heat-treat it and test what comes back. The software reads that result. Simulation",
      "source": "measured_boundary"
    },
    {
      "id": "c4",
      "start": 18.76,
      "end": 25.6,
      "text": "narrows the choices. The loop decides what sample to make next. That moves routine fabrication, characterization",
      "source": "measured_boundary"
    },
    {
      "id": "c5",
      "start": 25.74,
      "end": 31.76,
      "text": "and computation inside a repeating circuit. But the hypothesis stays outside. So do interpretation",
      "source": "measured_boundary"
    },
    {
      "id": "c6",
      "start": 32.26,
      "end": 38.28,
      "text": "and the metallurgical decisions that drive discovery. The machines are not running now. The agreement",
      "source": "measured_boundary"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7",
      "start": 38.92,
      "end": 44.38,
      "text": "begins the work of building them. The facility is meant for researchers beyond Texas A&M, in person",
      "source": "measured_boundary"
    },
    {
      "id": "c8",
      "start": 44.84,
      "end": 50.08,
      "text": "or remote, through competitive review. The public record names competitive review.",
      "source": "measured_boundary"
    },
    {
      "id": "c9",
      "start": 51.06,
      "end": 54.14,
      "text": "The next thing to watch is who puts the first question into the loop.",
      "source": "measured_boundary"
    }
  ],
